      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 14,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/rev-anti-debug.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:e6b671849169c4c9a08b8dff8a5d858a9ea9b052006be9d535aaad7309215813",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "反调试识别与绕过",
      "section": [
        "反调试识别与绕过",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 定位反调试调用（ptrace(PTRACE_TRACEME)、IsDebuggerPresent、NtQueryInformationProcess）。\n2. 静态 patch 返回值/跳转，或用 LD_PRELOAD/Frida hook。\n3. 时间差检测用断点后改时钟/跳过比较；异常检测注意调试器异常配置。\n4. 绕过后再验证真实逻辑是否可达。",
      "line_start": 15,
      "line_end": 18,
      "truncated": false
    },
